--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Method: vlan 61 carries no host NIC, so the control plane is read with the DUT's own
  tcpdump at privileged exec. A fresh group (239.2.2.2) was joined first so the whole
  tree build could be watched from cold.

awplus#tcpdump -i vlan61 -c 18 -nn
03:43:38.943301 IP 10.0.61.1    > 224.0.0.13: PIMv2, Hello, length 34
03:43:39.659544 IP 10.38.22.34  > 10.0.61.2 : PIMv2, Register, length 62
03:43:39.660110 IP 10.0.61.2    > 224.0.0.13: PIMv2, Join / Prune, length 34
