18 packets captured
  (far side, same leg: 18 of 20 subject frames on eth4, 20 of 20 instrument control)

  Read in order: the DUT -- as 10.38.22.34, its DR address on the SOURCE interface, not
  its transit address -- unicasts a Register to the RP; 0.6 ms later the RP sends a
  Join/Prune toward the source; 340 ms after that the group's data is flowing NATIVELY
  on vlan 61. Repeated with a PIM-only filter and a third group (239.3.3.3) to catch the
  end of the handshake:

awplus#tcpdump -i vlan61 -c 10 -nn proto 103
03:44:53.378341 IP 10.0.61.2   > 224.0.0.13 : PIMv2, Hello, length 34
