03:44:54.284280 IP 10.0.61.2   > 10.38.22.34: PIMv2, Register Stop, length 18
03:45:02.675409 IP 10.38.22.34 > 10.0.61.2  : PIMv2, Register, length 66   <-- data register
03:45:02.676041 IP 10.0.61.2   > 224.0.0.13 : PIMv2, Join / Prune, length 34
03:45:03.011682 IP 10.38.22.34 > 10.0.61.2  : PIMv2, Register, length 66
03:45:03.354785 IP 10.38.22.34 > 10.0.61.2  : PIMv2, Register, length 66
03:45:03.355179 IP 10.0.61.2   > 10.38.22.34: PIMv2, Register Stop, length 18
03:45:08.943538 IP 10.0.61.1   > 224.0.0.13 : PIMv2, Hello, length 34
03:45:17.064200 IP 10.38.22.34 > 10.0.61.2  : PIMv2, Register, length 28   <-- null keepalive
